  "prefLabel": "Sw 212.01 Role of Commission Staff in Enforcement or Disciplinary Hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sw 212.01 Role of Commission Staff in Enforcement or Disciplinary Hearings. Unless called as witnesses, commission staff shall have no role in any enforcement or disciplinary hearing.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Sw 200) #12093, eff 1-27-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sw200.html"
